WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.000
Komorebi is a small, fast and free email client for Windows. No AI, no telemetry.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.500
It starts in under 200 ms, and your cached mail list shows in under 600 ms.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.000
Read in light or dark. Komorebi draws mail with its own HTML engine, not a web engine.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Write with fonts, colours, lists, tables and named signatures.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Recipients turn into chips, and incomplete addresses are flagged.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Rules sort your mail, and you can copy them as Sieve.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.500
Contacts sync over CardDAV.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.500
The calendar syncs over CalDAV, with month, week, day and agenda views.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:29.500
Remote images stay blocked until you load them. The local cache can be encrypted.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.000
A per-user installer of about 8.9 MB, with presets for Purelymail and Postale.io.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.800
Free and open source. Get Komorebi at komorebi.rusticstack.com.
